[1.269,"o","\u001b[H\r\u001b[6B\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mPlease implement this issue.\u001b[39m                                                            \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m#21 Filter the reports by customer\u001b[39m                                                      \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mWhen I talk to one customer I only want their invoices. Add \u001b[38;5;153m--customer <id>\u001b[38;5;231m to \u001b[38;5;153minvoicer\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;153msummary\u001b[38;5;231m and \u001b[38;5;153minvoicer aging\u001b[38;5;231m: with it, the report covers only that customer's invoices. \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231mThe id is the customer's \u001b[38;5;153mid\u001b[38;5;231m in the file, such as \u001b[38;5;153macme\u001b[38;5;231m.\u001b[39m                                  \r\u001b[1B                                                                                          \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m- Without \u001b[38;5;153m--customer\u001b[38;5;231m, the reports print exactly what they print today.\u001b[39m                  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;5;231m- An id that no invoice has is an error that names the id.\u001b[39m                              \r\u001b[13B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[3GRe\u001b[38;5;216mtic\u001b[38;5;174mulating… \r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\u001b[K\u001b[34;1H\u001b[32;3H"]
